WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.720
Hello everyone. It's activity time.

2
00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:10.440
Today we will make a dog. A dog. Woof, woof.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.540
Let's make a cute dog. Let's look at what we need today.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.850
Origami paper. Origami paper.

5
00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:25.320
One more time. Origami paper.

6
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:37.200
Colored pencil. Colored pencil.

7
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.280
One more time. Colored pencil.

8
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:55.350
We need origami paper and a colored pencil. Can you say that with me?

9
00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.761
Origami paper, colored pencil.

10
00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.190
Origami paper.

11
00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.880
Colored pencil.

12
00:01:20.551 --> 00:01:21.360
Brilliant.

13
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.240
Now, your teacher will give you the paper and a colored pencil.

14
00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:32.100
Let's wait together. Can you say, "Paper, please?"

15
00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:34.770
Colored pencil, please.

16
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.740
Do you remember what we are making?

17
00:01:40.711 --> 00:01:44.160
A dog. Yes, a dog.

18
00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.810
Dog. Woof, woof. Ready?

19
00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:55.740
Look at my dog. It's a dog. A cute

20
00:01:55.891 --> 00:02:00.420
dog. This is the head. These are the ears.

21
00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.610
These are the eyes. This is the nose. Dog.

22
00:02:06.391 --> 00:02:12.150
Say it with me. Dog. One more time. Dog.

23
00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.150
Are you ready to fold?

24
00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:28.950
Turn the paper like this.

25
00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:34.980
Now it looks like a diamond. Good job. Get ready.

26
00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:41.820
Fold in half. Top corner to bottom corner. Fold.

27
00:02:43.891 --> 00:02:44.430
Press.

28
00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:48.750
Good.

29
00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.460
Now we have a triangle.

30
00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.300
Fold again.

31
00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.260
Left corner to right corner.

32
00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.641
Fold in half. Press.

33
00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.940
Good. Open it. Unfold.

34
00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:17.550
Good.

35
00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.590
Now we can see the middle line.

36
00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.440
Let's make an ear.

37
00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:32.490
Take the right corner, fold it down

38
00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:33.660
like this.

39
00:03:37.291 --> 00:03:37.800
Good.

40
00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:39.840
One ear.

41
00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:46.620
Now the left corner. Fold it down like this.

42
00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:53.190
Good. Two ears. Dog ears.

43
00:03:55.620 --> 00:04:00.090
Turn it over. Turn over.

44
00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:07.260
Good job. Okay, now fold the top corner down like

45
00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:07.770
this.

46
00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:15.810
Oh, wow. It's starting to look like a dog. Now the bottom corner.

47
00:04:17.041 --> 00:04:20.281
Fold it up. A little fold.

48
00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:28.470
Good. Turn it over again. Oh, wow.

49
00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.130
It looks like a dog.

50
00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.310
Now, take your colored pencil.

51
00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.580
Draw two eyes.

52
00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.580
One, two.

53
00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.531
Then draw a nose

54
00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.110
and a mouth.

55
00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.330
What is it?

56
00:04:56.130 --> 00:05:00.660
It's a dog. One more time. Dog.

57
00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.680
Very good. Do you like your dog?

58
00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:17.701
Yes. Great job, everyone. See you again soon. Bye-bye.
